Output docs/assets/10-health.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set Theme "Catppuccin Frappe"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 560
Set Padding 20
Set Margin 18
Set MarginFill "#1e1e2e"
Set BorderRadius 12
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set CursorBlink false
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type "nvim -u docs/vhs/demo-init.lua docs/vhs/demo/chapters/01_the_harbor.md"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Type ":Story health"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Hide
Type ":qa!"
Enter
